WEBVTT

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.900
Bored!

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.970
You're supposed to pass these days 
lost in thought...

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.220
Opening the box in your heart 
that you'd long ago closed...

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.040
But I'm bored!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.110
You're an idiot, you know that?

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:57.000
Haven't you any idea of 
what it means to be Japanese?

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:02.270
Um, no... Not really, I guess.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.780
Shut up!

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.950
It was raining back then, wasn't it?

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:10.960
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:10.960
<b>Memory Maiden</b>

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.180
How many years has it been?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:23.800
It was on a day like today that 
I first met my lord...

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.840
I still served Kubou-sama in the capital.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.460
What's going on?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.230
Oh, Akechi-sama.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.670
Actually, we're trying to do something

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.720
to relieve our boredom from this long rain.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:05.490
OK, ready!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.720
Set...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.310
Go!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.770
Who's next?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.280
Will no one else challenge Nobunaga?

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.320
I'll go!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.330
M-Me, too!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.080
Me, too!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.410
Whatever... All of you, come at once!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.410
Who is that?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.730
The lord of Owari.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:48.790
She is?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.910
Are we done?

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:54.890
Will no one else entertain me?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:02.620
You!

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.320
Fight me.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.780
OK, ready...

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.740
Set...

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.020
Go!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.980
Not bad.

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.360
What is your name?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.600
Akechi...

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.370
Mitsuhide...

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.260
Mitsuhide?

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.520
Mitsuhide!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.530
What is it Oda-dono?

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.210
Want to go on a trip?

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.600
No, thanks.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.230
What?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:24.360
If you stay inside on a day like this, 
you'll get moldy.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:28.360
I have things to do.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.170
What are you doing?

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.340
Give that back.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.970
That's Kubou-sama's...

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.520
If you want it back,

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:41.910
stop whining and follow me.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.460
I said no...

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.200
Mitsuhide,

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.260
you care too much about stupid stuff.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:54.260
You need to enjoy yourself more.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:59.550
Once in a while, you should get out, 
enjoy the fresh air,

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.320
and let the glorious sun shine down on you.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.450
Hey, Mitsuhide!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.200
The river water's still cold.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.670
Here's a present for you.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.720
Do you dislike fish, Mitsuhide?

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.110
No, that's not it...

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.490
OK, next.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:28.000
Follow me, Mitsuhide!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.640
Thanks.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.210
<i>I'd heard the rumors,</i>

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:50.790
<i>but she's even wilder than I'd imagined.</i>

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.740
<i>Why must I suffer through this?</i>

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.990
<i>I can't understand it.</i>

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.590
<i>I can't understand it, but...</i>

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.900
Here you go...

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.000
Nobunaga-sama,

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.410
that's not how you drink that...

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.450
Don't whine.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.250
You're too by-the-book, you know that?

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.730
Mitsuhide...

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.300
I return to Owari tomorrow.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:01.140
Would you help me, Mitsuhide?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.950
I want to conquer this land!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.730
For that, I'll need your wisdom and talent.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:19.210
My lord offered water to a parched life.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.490
How happy I was then...

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:31.200
I'm certain those words 
were said to me alone!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.420
There's no way that's true!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.100
No way, my lord!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.850
Yeah, Hideyoshi?

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:39.430
You're really terrible at this.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.930
I don't get it...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.760
Stop throwing your cards around 
when you lose!

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.480
Stupid.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.980
Then what should we do next?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.110
<b>Conquest</b>

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:00.620
OK, I'll show you something interesting.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.340
It's like a ninja mansion!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.400
Follow me!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.880
What's back here?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.660
Don't hit your head.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.660
So, this is what's inside the walls?

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.580
Is this a theme park attraction?

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.580
It's to keep intruders out.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.580
I see.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.090
What is this?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.420
This is the inspection tunnel.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.590
It has to be small and cramped.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:02.590
They look like they could 
attack us at any minute.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.350
It's fine. Don't worry.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.100
They're all turned off.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:12.500
But don't touch anything.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.650
We don't want them restarted.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.610
I'm scared, my lord!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.170
I'm going on ahead.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.980
Wait! Wait!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.420
Um, my lord?

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:38.260
You don't smoke, 
so why do you always carry that?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:40.170
This?

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:42.710
This is a good luck charm.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:43.680
A good luck charm?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.290
Yeah.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.980
You stupid child!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.230
Why are you such a tomboy?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:57.360
How many times will you 
force your mother to repeat this?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:04.480
You are the lord of this place, 
of Nagoya Castle!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.870
And still, you refuse to act like it!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.290
You must learn to behave yourself!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.760
Come now, Nobuhide-dono.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:18.300
There's no need to yell at her.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.720
Mother!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:23.180
I, Nobusada, shall take the child.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.420
Understand?

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.930
Very well.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:31.430
Nobunaga, will you come with me?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.180
Why did you hurt them?

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.660
They wouldn't listen to me.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:42.650
So I taught them a lesson.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.520
Taught them a lesson?

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.910
I want to show you something.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:54.770
Listen well.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:13:00.300
From ancient times, it's been said that 
she who controls the water, controls the land.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.520
Through the mastery of water, 
drawn from mighty rivers,

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.530
the fields grow.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:12.490
However, if you try to force it 
to stop or overflow,

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.560
it will instantly rebel.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:18.270
The hearts of women are like the water.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.810
Force them to obey, and they will rebel.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.820
You must not force.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:28.320
The hearts of women are like the water...

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.900
I give this to you.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.660
If, in the future,

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.210
you find yourself leaning toward violence,

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.570
grip this tightly, and wait for it to pass.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.110
Can you do that?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.880
I don't understand.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:48.680
I see... You don't.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:52.570
But someday, you will.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.830
Nobunaga...

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.800
Become worthy to conquer the entire land.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:08.360
It is a dear memory of Nobusada-dono.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.660
That's a great story!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:17.120
But for all that, you're still 
really short-tempered.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.460
Don't say that.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.910
Back there, you threw the cards.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.030
I said don't say it.

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:25.120
Granny Nobusada must be spinning in her grave.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.260
I said don't—

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.090
See?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.010
It's not that easy to fix.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.550
You should try!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.380
But yeah, we need to find all the armor pieces

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:38.980
and conquer the land, 
for your grandmother's sake, too!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.520
I'm ready to help, any way I can!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.770
Just let me handle everything!

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.360
Well, maybe everything isn't a good idea...

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.580
You're too cocky.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:53.350
What about you? Do you have anything?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.620
Well, I don't...

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.870
This, maybe?

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.920
I bought it, so I wouldn't fail my test...

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.800
And after that...

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.480
That accident happened.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:21.240
I wonder if this works...

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:25.250
Let's head back.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.210
OK.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.030
What?

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.590
You idiot!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.380
You turned them on!

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.780
Isn't this really bad?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.400
This is gonna kill us!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.370
It's meant to keep out ninjas!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.080
Anyway, stop touching stuff.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.370
Jeez...

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.920
I get it!

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.920
Where's the exit?

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.700
What time is it, anyway?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.720
It's dinnertime now, isn't it?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.530
I'm hungry.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:28.130
Do you have anything to eat my lord?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.960
Also, I'm thirsty...

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:30.670
Shut up!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.780
Ah.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.090
Not "ah"...

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.880
Masamune-dono?

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:58.240
Looks like you're collecting the armor quickly.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.050
I'm glad to see that.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:02.660
It's thanks to your information.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:04.270
Not at all.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.350
Even if you know where they are,

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.750
acquiring them isn't easy.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.520
That's true, but...

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:15.140
By the way, I've been wanting to ask...

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:16.400
What is it?

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:20.750
Why do you not take the armor for yourself?

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.180
Oh, that?

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:57.260
I'm not up to the task.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:02.550
I have no talent for war, and I'm no warrior.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:07.260
I believe Nobunaga-dono alone 
is worthy to wear the armor.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:08.970
I see.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.400
There's no one but her, I agree.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:17.070
I'm envious. She trusts you...

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:22.220
How far does this go on?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.110
Lake Biwa.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:23.870
No way!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.640
Somewhere around here, 
there's an escape route...

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.180
Can't we just drift out?

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:36.340
Didn't your grandma tell you not 
to go against the water?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.200
That isn't what she meant!

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.310
If we keep floating along with it,

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.380
we'll drown before we reach Lake Biwa.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:48.310
Still, she's been acting strangely of late.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.490
She has you as her right hand,

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:54.610
yet she seems oddly taken 
with that Hideyoshi girl.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:19:00.010
From my perspective, 
I think you're more than sufficient.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:04.590
But in the end, she must 
be expecting greater things from you

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:08.870
than anyone else in the search for the armor.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.590
Yes, I'll do my best.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:13.880
You need not tell me.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.050
H-Hey...

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:21.800
This is it!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:38.690
I'll see that her wish comes true...

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.070
even at the cost of my life!

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.540
Truly, the desire of a warrior.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:54.960
Where are we?

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.340
So, we came out here.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.090
What happened, my lord?

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.300
Akerin, it was crazy!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:02.970
You see...

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:04.990
Get away from her!

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:06.890
I said get away!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.400
Mitsuhide, calm down!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.600
Calm down!

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.990
Akerin, got another towel?

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.230
You're soaked... What happened?

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.400
Anyway, that was...

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.630
Hideyoshi!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.370
You'll catch cold, too.

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:28.810
I'll have the people in the castle 
make you something warm.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:29.650
Come.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.460
Yay!

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.010
How about you, Masamune-dono?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.070
Something warm!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:34.670
I'll take you up on that.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:36.310
Masamune-san!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.130
Hide-san...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:28.880
<b>Date-Sensei 
Hirata Yuka</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:52.490
<b>Sengoku Otome Style Preview</b>

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:28.130
OK, we'll practice our acting today.

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:29.750
Acting?

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:31.590
<b>Hideyoshino 
Hidaka Rina</b>

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:30.830
Yes, acting.

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:31.840
OK! Let's do it.

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:32.400
OK.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.990
First, try Ieyasu-chan.

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:36.130
Ieyasu-chan?

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:36.740
Ieyasu-chan.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:38.070
What should I say?

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:41.480
The line of hers that you remember most.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:43.520
Three... Two... One...

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.670
Ieyasu-chan...

00:23:45.710 --> 00:23:47.080
Useless!

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:49.080
That isn't right... That isn't right, is it?

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:52.490
No, you shouldn't bring yourself down.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.610
Preview

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.610
Drama Maiden

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.960
Watch next time, OK?
